# CODEOWNERS — automatic review assignment
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner> [<owner2> ...]
# Last entry matching a path wins.

# Default: all files require core team review
*                                   @ZolttyAI/core

# Model architecture — requires ML lead sign-off
/zolt/model.py                      @ZolttyAI/core @ZolttyAI/ml
/zolt/config.py                     @ZolttyAI/core @ZolttyAI/ml
/zolt/rope_scaling.py               @ZolttyAI/core @ZolttyAI/ml
/zolt/train.py                      @ZolttyAI/core @ZolttyAI/ml

# Inference stack — requires infra review
/zolt/inference/                    @ZolttyAI/core @ZolttyAI/infra

# Data pipeline — requires data team review
/zolt/data/                         @ZolttyAI/core @ZolttyAI/data

# CI / release workflows — any workflow change needs core sign-off
/.github/workflows/                 @ZolttyAI/core
/.github/CODEOWNERS                 @ZolttyAI/core

# Security-sensitive files
/SECURITY.md                        @ZolttyAI/core
/pyproject.toml                     @ZolttyAI/core

# Docs — lighter review, any core member suffices
/README.md                          @ZolttyAI/core
/CONTRIBUTING.md                    @ZolttyAI/core
/ARCHITECTURE.md                    @ZolttyAI/core
/CHANGELOG.md                       @ZolttyAI/core
